{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14853","headline":"难绾刀子歌 · 卢纶","name":"难绾刀子歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"黄金鞘里青芦叶，丽若翦成銛且翣。\n轻冰薄玉状不分，一尺寒光堪决云。\n吹毛可试不可触，似有虫搜阙裂文。\n淬之几堕前池水，焉知不是蛟龙子。\n割鸡刺虎皆若空，愿应君心逐君指。\n幷州难绾竟何人，每成此物如有神。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14853.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14853","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}